{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And they fulfilled for him.</b> They completed for him the days of his embalming until they fulfilled for him forty days." "<b>And Egypt wept for him seventy days.</b> Forty for embalming and thirty for weeping, because blessing had come to them through him every year — the famine ended and the waters of the Nile were blessed."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:04:22.769341418Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}